  "elements": [
    {
      "id": "OMwmc8OE73aoQPmiWWFYr",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 455,
      "y": 150,
      "width": 943.139404296875,
      "height": 325,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "a1",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1166538134,
      "version": 909,
      "versionNonce": 261459850,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1758532868266,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Step 1: Requirement Gathering\n    a. We have to accomodate size wise divided vehicles in different slots\n    b. Each slot type has different cost associated\n    c. Each vehicle is issued a parking ticket on entry, have to pay before exiting\n    d. We calculate cost on hourly basis with minimum x amount for first hour (base cost) then  \n        every subsequent hour cost increase with relation to extra time...different type of vehicle\n        attracts different wait time cost value as well\n    e. Multiple types of payment are supported (Paypal, upi, cash, card)\n    f. Vehicle is allowed to exit only after paying this cost amount.\n\n    Rules- \n    a. A vehicle cannot exit without paying\n    b. Vehicle can only be occupied if empty slot is avalaible otherwise do not enter",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Step 1: Requirement Gathering\n    a. We have to accomodate size wise divided vehicles in different slots\n    b. Each slot type has different cost associated\n    c. Each vehicle is issued a parking ticket on entry, have to pay before exiting\n    d. We calculate cost on hourly basis with minimum x amount for first hour (base cost) then  \n        every subsequent hour cost increase with relation to extra time...different type of vehicle\n        attracts different wait time cost value as well\n    e. Multiple types of payment are supported (Paypal, upi, cash, card)\n    f. Vehicle is allowed to exit only after paying this cost amount.\n\n    Rules- \n    a. A vehicle cannot exit without paying\n    b. Vehicle can only be occupied if empty slot is avalaible otherwise do not enter",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "f_S6UC12MPyynAmpz6D66",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 474.203125,
      "y": 514.14453125,
      "width": 706.6595458984375,
      "height": 150,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "a2",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1654584790,
      "version": 541,
      "versionNonce": 1848024534,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1758533146763,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Feedback: \n1. Consider type of vehicle also - car, bike, handicapped, ev etc\n2. Consider who is using the service - Driver, my operator etc\n3. Consider the case when user loses ticket - apply penalty condition\n4. Create abstract factory type thing so that multiple such can be kept\n5. Consider parallel entry and exit of vehicles, handle race condition",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Feedback: \n1. Consider type of vehicle also - car, bike, handicapped, ev etc\n2. Consider who is using the service - Driver, my operator etc\n3. Consider the case when user loses ticket - apply penalty condition\n4. Create abstract factory type thing so that multiple such can be kept\n5. Consider parallel entry and exit of vehicles, handle race condition",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
